 en:{k:"Global GTM · AI Commercialization",org:"Lightwheel · GTM Strategy & AI PM Intern · Apr – May 2026",t:"Business Development in North America & Europe: From Lead to Contract",r:"Drove business development in North America and Europe for three product lines — human-behavior data, simulation assets and a robot-evaluation platform; built the lead system full-stack, solo",
  b:["Defined four customer personas — training researchers, simulation engineers, robotics start-ups and big-tech AI labs — then used Sales Navigator to find and verify decision-makers, mapping organizations and contacts at key accounts such as Amazon FAR, OpenAI, Meta FAIR and Skild AI.","Ran four parallel A/B/C/D email sequences on Apollo.io with personalized openers drawn from LinkedIn profiles, fed by a signal-driven lead system I built (hiring, funding and launch signals, with three-layer anti-hallucination checks). Cold-email replies rose from under 5% to 15%, and daily BD reach per person more than tripled.","Worked directly with NVIDIA, DeepMind, Physical Intelligence and others, from discovery, sample delivery and pricing negotiation to contract signature and acceptance, tracking opportunities in the CRM through NDA, samples, quote, proposal and MSA + SOW.","Turned quote, proposal and acceptance-report generation into a reusable AI Skill, cutting quote turnaround from hours to under 10 minutes; built a marketing-intelligence agent in Feishu that processes over 5× more information each week."],
  m:[["<5% → 15%","Cold-email reply rate"],["3×","Daily BD reach per person"],["Hours → <10 min","Quote turnaround"]],tags:["Global prospecting","CRM","A/B testing","LLM applications","Full stack"]},
